meta {
  name: Concurrent Process KYC
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/process-kyc/01K7JK5M-JNQHQ35RN-18WBH0XTB
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

vars:pre-request {
  ~host: http://localhost
}

script:post-response {
  const response = res.body;

  if (res.status === 202) {
    console.log('✅ KYC Jobs successfully queued');
    console.log(`📊 Total Jobs: ${response.total_jobs}`);
    console.log(`🆔 Job IDs: ${JSON.stringify(response.job_ids)}`);
    console.log(`📈 Queue Stats:`, response.queue_stats);
  } else {
    console.log('❌ Failed to queue KYC jobs');
  }
}

docs {
  # Concurrent KYC Processing

  This endpoint processes multiple KYC records concurrently using a worker queue system.

  ## Features:
  - **Concurrent Processing**: Multiple workers process KYC requests in parallel
  - **Rate Limiting**: Controls API calls to Trulioo to prevent overload
  - **Job Tracking**: Returns job IDs for monitoring progress
  - **Queue Stats**: Shows current queue status and worker information

  ## Response:
  - **Status 202**: Jobs successfully queued for processing
  - **job_ids**: Array of job identifiers for tracking
  - **queue_stats**: Current queue status and worker metrics

  ## Configuration:
  Environment variables control concurrency:
  - `WORKER_POOL_SIZE`: Number of concurrent workers (default: 5)
  - `JOB_QUEUE_SIZE`: Maximum jobs in queue (default: 100)
  - `TRULIOO_RATE_LIMIT`: API calls per second (default: 10)
}